     ggrrddcc — grand digital clock (curses)

SSYYNNOOPPSSIISS
     ggrrddcc [--sstt] [_n]

DDEESSCCRRIIPPTTIIOONN
     ggrrddcc runs a digital clock made of reverse-video blanks on a curses com‐
     patible VDU screen.  With an optional numeric argument _n it stops after _n
     seconds (default never).  The optional --ss flag makes digits scroll as
     they change.  The optional --tt flag tells grdc to output the time in a
     12-hour format.  In this curses mode implementation, the scrolling option
     has trouble keeping up.

